# Draft only; maintainers decide whether this is distinct from E007.
id:                     DRAFT-proxsmtp-1.10-capability-split
trigger_tool:           configure|clang|conan
phase:                  configuration, build, testing
severity:               2
category:               platform-feature-detection
error_signature:        Could not find the libcap2 libraries|cap_get_proc in -lcap... no
match_keywords:         HarmonyOS, OHOS, autotools, libcap, IP_TRANSPARENT, tproxy, capability, partial adaptation
title:                  同一代理程序的 libcap 与 IP_TRANSPARENT 应分开判定
root_cause:             ProxSMTP 1.10 的 Linux capabilities 与 IP_TRANSPARENT 是不同的可选功能。所测 OHOS PC 缺少 libcap，显式启用 capabilities 时 configure 失败；同机启用 IP_TRANSPARENT 却可配置并编译。用单一 Linux 平台标签或一个头文件探针不能替代逐功能构建和运行验证。
affected_scope:         含有 Linux capabilities、透明套接字、普通网络服务多个可选层级的 Autotools 项目
verification_cmd:       CC=clang ./configure --build=aarch64-unknown-ohos --host=aarch64-unknown-ohos --enable-capabilities --disable-tproxy; CC=clang ./configure --build=aarch64-unknown-ohos --host=aarch64-unknown-ohos --disable-capabilities --enable-tproxy; conan create archives/p/proxsmtp/1.10 -pr:h=ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ohos-aarch64 -c tools.build:jobs=1
rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           split-optional-capability-evidence
rec_description:        先解决 E007 的平台识别；分别验证 libcap 链接、IP_TRANSPARENT 编译、普通网络功能以及需要特权的透明模式运行。缺失 libcap 时仅禁用该层，不能据此宣称 IP_TRANSPARENT 也不可用；只编译 IP_TRANSPARENT 也不能宣称特权运行通过。
rec_command:            --disable-capabilities --enable-tproxy
rec_auto_fix:           false
principles:
causes:
caused_by:
similar_to:             E007（平台三元组识别；不覆盖可选网络能力逐层判定）
conflicts_with:
prerequisite_of:
doc_file:               drafts/DRAFT-proxsmtp-1.10-capability-split.md
last_updated:           2026-09-26
source_event:           archives/p/proxsmtp/1.10/conanfile.py
authors:                tank_you
